  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Norra Ghana Shea (NGS) &#xe4;r ett socialt f&#xf6;retag. NGS syfte &#xe4;r att ge m&#xf6;jlighet till anst&#xe4;llning/f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning f&#xf6;r kvinnor i Upper West Region genom processing och f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;ljning av sheaprodukter. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Concern Universal, Ghana, org.nr G.5274, Ghana.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northern Ghana Shea (NGS) is a social enterprise. NGS seeks to provide a sustainable avenue for wealth creation and employment      generations to rural women in the Upper West Region through the processing and marketing of high quality shea butter. They will       process teh butter from nuts purchased from local women nuts pickers. They will also teach women to produce better quality. Agreement partner is Concern Universal, Ghana, org reg no G.5274, Ghana.</narrative>
  </description>
